Package: afterglow
Title: Half-Life-Aware Kinetic Bracketing from Standard RNA-seq
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Jinlu", family = "Huyan",
           email = "jinlu.huyan@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(given = "Jianbo", family = "Xiu",
           role = c("aut", "ths"))
  )
Description: Provides documented workflows for model-specified kinetic
    bracketing analyses that account for gene-specific mRNA half-life.
    The package reads Transcriptome Turnover Database (TTDB) tables or
    user-supplied half-life tables, computes expression-equivalent fold-changes
    under pulse and synthesis-rate limiting models, reports model-aware
    confidence diagnostics, evaluates half-life perturbation sensitivity, and
    can run differential-expression screening on the inferred matrix.
